-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Earth-Agent
https://github.com/opendatalab/Earth-Agent
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

RSMeM was initially developed from the Earth-Agent codebase and was
substantially refactored into a modular package. In particular, the agent
execution, logging, experiment orchestration, and evaluation code under
`rsmem/` derives in part from Earth-Agent's
`scripts/langchain_deepseek_autoplan.py`, while the scripts under
`evaluation/` are adapted from Earth-Agent's `evaluate/` and `process/`
directories. All subsequent modifications and the RSMeM-specific HKG and FAR
components are maintained by the RSMeM authors.

